<title>PERU: Peru's stock, financial markets closed Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Peru's stock, financial markets closed Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lima Stock Exchange and Peru's financial markets will not open Tuesday for the second successive day due to a national holiday celebrating the 176th anniversary of the country's independence from Spain.</p>
<p>The markets will re-open Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
